H(488,3,"Autoscale do App Service","Scale-out: **CPU máxima > 85%** por 5 min → +1; scale-in: média < 30% por 5 min → −1 (cooldown 5). Caso 1: só os últimos 5 min passam de 85%, então 1 → **2**. Caso 2: com 90% por 1 hora chega ao máximo (5); em 9 minutos abaixo de 25% só há tempo para **um** scale-in (5 min + cooldown), então ficam **4**. O dump marcava 5 e 3.",
  slots=[("If after deployment CPU usage is 70 percent for one hour and then reaches 90 percent for five minutes, at that time the total number of instances will be [answer choice].","1|2|3|4|5",1),
         ("If after deployment the CPU maintains constant usage of 90 percent for one hour, and then the average CPU usage is below 25 percent for nine minutes, at that point the number of instances will be [answer choice].","1|2|3|4|5",3)], ans_orig=[4,2], r="corrigida")
H(494,3,"VMSS — upgrade policy","Com **upgrade policy Automatic**, mudanças no modelo (como o tamanho) são aplicadas a **todas as 4** instâncias ao mesmo tempo. Upgrades automáticos de imagem do SO atualizam no máximo **20% por lote (mínimo 1)**: com 4 instâncias, **1** por vez. O dump marcava 0 e 4.",
  slots=[("When an administrator changes the virtual machine size, the size will be changed on up to [answer choice] virtual machines simultaneously.","0|1|2|4",3),
         ("When a new build of the Windows Server 2016 image is released, the new build will be deployed to up to [answer choice] virtual machines simultaneously.","0|1|2|4",1)], ans_orig=[0,3], r="duvidosa")
